    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Part  Sokoban style, block pushing and fusing game which evolves into something that will push your puzzle-solving skills; part  platformer involving throwing a ball to complete more complex levels as you progress. Eventually, these 2 parts will combine into a multi-dimensional puzzle/platformer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are currently over 100 Sokoban-style levels and over 10 platforming stages to complete.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Part  Sokoban style, block pushing and fusing game which evolves into something that will push your puzzle-solving skills; part  platformer involving throwing a ball to complete more complex levels as you progress. Eventually, these 2 parts will combine into a multi-dimensional puzzle/platformer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are currently over 100 Sokoban-style levels and over 10 platforming stages to complete.</p>",
